// Team-owned location reads: ONE shared TeamPile for team Red. The bare name
// resolves to the team pile while a Red member is current; `TeamPile of
// T:Red` addresses it explicitly; `owner of top(TeamPile)` reports the team;
// `(&I:TeamFlag of T:Red)` reads the single team slot `Red_TeamFlag`.
player P1, P2, P3
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2, P:P3)
team Red with (P:P1, P:P2)
location TeamPile on T:Red
location Hand on all
location Deck on table
memory Who on table
memory TeamFlag 7 on T:Red

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 3 times {
  deal 1 from top(Deck) private to TeamPile
  Who is owner of top(TeamPile)
  cycle to next
}

stage Score for current 1 times {
  score size(cards TeamPile of T:Red) to P:P1
  score (&I:TeamFlag of T:Red) to P:P2
  end stage
}
